<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia needs stronger jobs growth - Vanstone.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia needs stronger jobs growth - Vanstone.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Employment Minister Amanda Vanstone said much stronger jobs growth was needed to secure lower unemployment.</p>
<p>&quot;We are now beginning to see the benefits of the government's policy to bring about fundamental changes to the economy and to create real jobs,&quot; Vanstone said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Much stronger employment growth is needed however to bring the unemployment rate down substantially.&quot;</p>
</text>
